<title>UK: Great Eastern Shipping sets $50 mln seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Great Eastern Shipping sets $50 mln seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Australia and New Zealand Banking Group.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GREAT EASTERN SHIPPING CO</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    OCT.2003</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +135 BP   PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.85     ISS PRICE  99.85     FULL FEES   0.625</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
